# Agentic SDLC

- Start from `vault/00 Home.md` and `vault/board/SDLC Kanban.md`.
- Implement one story at a time. Load `.cursor/skills/<assignee_role>/SKILL.md`.
- When status changes, update story frontmatter and the kanban card in the same turn.
- Vault notes plus `ResumeToWord_PRD.docx` are the contract. Chat is not.
- Do not start P1 (`US-080`–`US-083`) from kickoff.
- Planned code lives in `apps/web/`, `workers/convert/`, and `infra/`.
- Follow `AGENTS.md` and `vault/_meta/SDLC Operating Model.md`.
